"Está conectado al Corredor Biológico Talamanca-Caribe y al Parque Nacional "
"Corcovado, formando uno de los mayores bloques de selva húmeda del mundo."
msgstr ""
"It is linked to the Talamanca-Caribbean Biological Corridor and Corcovado "
"National Park, forming one of the largest blocks of rainforest in the world."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1440
msgid ""
"Playas de arena blanca, acantilados y monos que bajan de los árboles: el "
"parque más visitado del país."
msgstr ""
"White-sand beaches, cliffs and monkeys coming down from the trees: the "
"country's most visited park."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1443
msgid ""
"Es el parque más visitado de Costa Rica y uno de los más pequeños con apenas "
"1 983 ha."
msgstr ""
"It is Costa Rica's most visited park and one of the smallest at just 1,983 "
"ha."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1444
