msgstr "Pack gear for heavy rain and heat."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1513
msgid ""
"Junto con Tortuguero forma el bloque de bosque tropical húmedo continuo más "
"grande de Mesoamérica; su creación protegió la integridad de la Península de "
"Osa."
msgstr ""
"Together with Tortuguero it forms the largest continuous block of tropical "
"rainforest in Mesoamerica; its creation protected the integrity of the Osa "
"Peninsula."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1520
msgid ""
"Volcán, fumarolas, lodo hirviente y cataratas: geología viva en Guanacaste."
msgstr ""
"Volcano, fumaroles, boiling mud and waterfalls: living geology in Guanacaste."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1523
msgid ""
"El complejo volcánico tiene nueve conos; el Von Seebach es el punto más alto "
"con 1 895 msnm."
msgstr ""
"The volcanic complex has nine cones; Von Seebach is the highest point at "
"1,895 m."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1524
msgid ""
"Concentra 32 ríos y decenas de cataratas; la catarata La Cangreja es la más "
"famosa."
msgstr ""
"It gathers 32 rivers and dozens of waterfalls; La Cangreja waterfall is the "
"most famous."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1525
msgid ""
"Sus fumarolas y ollas de lodo son un laboratorio natural de actividad "
"geotérmica."
msgstr ""
"Its fumaroles and mud pots are a natural laboratory of geothermal activity."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1526
msgid ""
"Forma parte del Área de Conservación Guanacaste, Patrimonio de la Humanidad "
"(UNESCO)."
msgstr ""
"It is part of the Guanacaste Conservation Area, a UNESCO World Heritage Site."

