msgstr "Bring a swimsuit, towel and water shoes."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1551
msgid "El camino a la catarata es de tierra: no apto para autos."
msgstr "The road to the waterfall is unpaved: not suitable for cars."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1553
msgid ""
"Forma parte del Área de Conservación Guanacaste, reconocida por la UNESCO "
"como Patrimonio de la Humanidad por su biodiversidad."
msgstr ""
"Part of the Guanacaste Conservation Area, recognised by UNESCO as a World "
"Heritage Site for its biodiversity."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1560
msgid ""
"Uno de los cráteres activos más grandes del mundo, accesible casi hasta el "
"borde."
msgstr ""
"One of the world's largest active craters, accessible almost to the rim."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1563
msgid ""
"Su cráter principal mide 1,3 km de diámetro y es uno de los más anchos del "
"planeta."
msgstr "Its main crater is 1.3 km across and one of the widest on the planet."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1564
msgid ""
"La laguna del cráter cambia de color y a veces desaparece por completo con "
"la temperatura."
msgstr ""
"The crater lake changes color and sometimes disappears entirely with "
"temperature."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1565
msgid ""
"El mirador está a pocos minutos del estacionamiento, ideal para visita de "
"medio día."
msgstr ""
"The viewpoint is a few minutes from the parking lot, ideal for a half-day "
"visit."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1566
msgid ""
"El acceso se controla por aforo y horario; la nubosidad puede ocultar el "
"cráter temprano."
msgstr ""
"Access is controlled by capacity and time; cloud cover can hide the crater "
"early on."

#: includes/class-destination-spots.php:1568
