msgstr "5. Who is traveling?"

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:589
msgid "Contanos sobre tu grupo para personalizar las recomendaciones."
msgstr "Tell us about your group to personalize the recommendations."

#: includes/class-itinerary.php:595
msgid ""
"Costa Rica es ideal para familias (tours de naturaleza, playas seguras), "
"parejas (lodges románticos, aventura) y grupos de amigos (rafting, surf, "
"vida nocturna). Algunos tours tienen edad mínima o restricciones de salud."
msgstr ""
"Costa Rica is ideal for families (nature tours, safe beaches), couples "
"(romantic lodges, adventure) and groups of friends (rafting, surfing, "
"nightlife). Some tours have minimum age or health restrictions."

