"desde el mirador. El parque se formó al fusionarse la Reserva Forestal Río "
"Macho y el Refugio de Fauna Silvestre Tapantí."
msgstr ""
"Tapantí–Macizo Cerro de la Muerte protects the largest cloud forest in the "
"central volcanic range. The quetzal nests in the canopy and can be seen with "
"a guide from the lookout. The park was formed by merging the Río Macho "
"Forest Reserve and the Tapantí Wildlife Refuge."

