"Cabo Blanco fue declarada reserva absoluta en 1963, la primera del país, "
"gracias a la iniciativa de Olof Wessberg y Karen Morgenson. Hoy protege unas "
"1 270 hectáreas de bosque seco, costa rocosa y mar. La playa donde nadaron "
"los Beatles recibe tortugas verdes cada temporada."
msgstr ""
"Cabo Blanco was declared an absolute reserve in 1963, the first in the "
"country, thanks to the initiative of Olof Wessberg and Karen Morgenson. It "
"now protects about 1,270 hectares of dry forest, rocky coast and sea. The "
"beach where the Beatles swam receives green turtles each season."

